      ((VAL.odds_holdout_hit || 0) * 100).toFixed(1) + '% hit at 0.5 against a ' + ((VAL.odds_base_rate || 0) * 100).toFixed(1) +
      '% base rate, Brier ' + (VAL.odds_holdout_brier || 0).toFixed(3) + '. The time split under-predicts how fast new listings launch — ' +
